WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.300
On the morning the sun failed to rise, every bell in the village rang thirteen times.

2
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:18.100
Far beyond the fields, the king’s adviser had stolen the Crown of Balance and twisted its magic.

3
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:27.800
Roads folded into loops. Rivers flowed uphill. Fiends prowled the path to the royal throne room.

4
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:36.600
You are the village apprentice who notices what everyone else is missing: the chaos follows a pattern.

5
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.400
Armed with spells and a talent for numbers, you set out to put the world right.

6
00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:52.700
Every correct answer fuels your magic. Every level strengthens your spells.

7
00:00:53.100 --> 00:01:01.200
Keep your answers true in an unbroken sequence, and an ancient dragon will answer your call.

8
00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:05.600
The Stolen Dawn
